L733: ### A.2 Hyperparameters
L734: 
L735: Table 3: Hyperparameters used in ReflexGrad experiments.
L736: Parameter  | Value
L737: History window size ($k$)  | 5
L738: Reflexion generation frequency  | Every 5 steps or on failure
L739: TextGrad gradient computation  | Every step
L740: Memory retrieval top-$k$  | 6
L741: Consolidated memory strength threshold  | 3.0
L742: Forgetting decay rate  | 0.995/hour
L743: Working memory compression (recent)  | 350 tokens
L744: Working memory compression (medium)  | 150 tokens
L745: Working memory compression (heavy)  | 100 tokens
