L82: We fine-tune SAM on the server side using the labeled dataset and Low-Rank Adaptation (LoRA), and then distribute the resulting teacher model, along with the public labeled dataset $\mathcal{D}_{p}$, to all clients for pseudo-supervision. On each client, this teacher distills knowledge into a lightweight semi-supervised model through an adaptive, agreement-driven mechanism.
